│ term."}, {"study_index": 199, "title": "Adding liraglutide to oral antidiabetic drug monotherapy: Efficacy and       │
│ weight benefits", "abstract": "AIM To examine the options for add-on therapy in patients with type 2 diabetes whose  │
│ disease is no longer adequately controlled by lifestyle interventions and oral antidiabetic drug (OAD)monotherapy.   │
