Review: Risk of fatal and nonfatal lactic acidosis with metformin use in type 2 diabetes mellitus
Total studies to screen: 5

SELECTION CRITERIA:
Prospective trials and observational cohort studies in patients with type 2 diabetes of least one month duration were 
included if they evaluated metformin, alone or in combination with other treatments, compared to placebo or any other 
